      "comment": "QEMU/RTL co-simulation generator: extracts individual peripherals out of a synthesizable CIRCT core dialects design into standalone SystemC models, wires each to QEMU over a remote-port channel, and runs QEMU alongside the RTL peripheral it talks to.",
      "service": "no"
    }
  },
  "systemLevelInfo": {
    "architecture": "RISC-V",
    "SWDependencies": "qemu-fdt, firtool, arcilator, Verilator, dtc, SystemC, Python 3"
